(10498,6,6,0,0,'As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Wildheart pieces in exchange for your new Feralheart Cowl and Vest?',0),
(10499,6,6,0,0,'As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Magister\'s pieces in exchange for your new Sorcerer\'s Crown and Robes?',0),
(11230,0,0,0,0,'What are you waiting for?  Kill the Alliance scum already!',0),
(11235,0,1,0,0,'I want those filthy creatures dead! They threaten us all over the fjord, and it\'s high time we put a stop to them by wiping them out at Ssssshhhhhalerbron.$B$B<The captain says the name of the vrykul fortress derisively.>',26822),
(11264,0,6,0,0,'Are you sure that you killed Mezhen and his necrolords, $r?',0),
(11284,0,1,0,0,'Have you had any luck removing that stupid yeti from my mine?',26822),
(11307,0,0,0,0,'Have you completed your field tests, $n?',0),
(11330,0,6,0,0,'Well? How\'d it go ...hic?',26822),
(11414,0,0,0,0,'<A low growl rises from Ulfang\'s throat.>$B$BBjomolf and Varg are not dead!',26654),
(11430,0,6,0,0,'Have you taken care of Yavus?',26654),
(11477,0,1,0,0,'You\'ll need to kill until you\'ve had your fill.',26654),
