(13968,0,0,0,0,'Does Tortusk still draw breath?',30706),
(13973,0,6,0,0,'I can see smoke from the neighboring building - what\'s going on out there?',30706),
(13980,0,0,0,0,'Have you eliminated the assassins, $c?',32028),
(13992,0,0,0,0,'I love watchin\' these guys scurry all over.',30706),
(13995,0,0,0,0,'Well, I suppose that\'s one way to track down Kurak. What happened up there?',30706),
(13998,0,0,0,0,'Out with it, $c! What happened at the oasis?',30706),
(14001,0,5,0,0,'I still see some out there! Please, $n, go get them before they drown!',0),
(14019,0,6,0,0,'Did it work?',30706),
(14021,0,6,0,0,'How did it go? How much kaja\'mite were you able to get?',30706),
(14038,0,0,0,0,'Did we make some nice kersplosions? Did we? ',30706),
(14042,0,0,0,0,'So... how fares Vice Admiral Hartley? Miserable, I hope?',30706),
(14046,0,0,0,0,'Get on with it, mate. The guards may be back any moment. Ye know what ta do.',30706),
(14065,0,6,0,0,'Did you eat enough at a Bountiful Table?',0),
(14066,0,0,0,0,'This Horde caravan was not merely robbed. It was savagely brutalized. Crates of supplies have been ripped apart by sharp claws. The wagon has been demolished. The food has been eaten and the silver is gone, and yet useful supplies have been left behind...',30706),
(14069,0,6,0,0,'A good start, $g sir : ma\'am;, but might I suggest that you may want to make an example of a few more?',30706),
(14070,0,6,0,0,'Is that all of them? Let\'s cross-check the list real quick just to be sure.',30706),
(14071,0,6,0,0,'The party\'s almost ready. How was your trip to town?',30706),
(14075,0,6,0,0,'I don\'t know, boss. I\'m still getting reports of worms eating all of the kaja\'mite in the mines.$B$BYou should head back down there and take care of them.',30706),
(14093,0,0,0,0,'Have the worgen been dealt with?',0),
(14098,0,0,0,0,'Have you succeeded, $n?',0),
(14113,0,6,0,0,'How\'s the party going?$B$BYou look amazing! So dashing and handsome, sir!',0),
(14115,0,6,0,0,'Was that all of them? I know that I saw a lot rushing in!',30706),
(14117,0,0,0,0,'Are the hills no longer alive, $c?',32305),
(14132,0,0,0,0,'Nightmares of claws snapping. Nightmares!',32305),
(14161,0,6,0,0,'Are those beasts good and dead?',32305),
(14165,0,5,0,0,'Get to the strip mine, $n, and get me a sample of one of my former workers!',32305),
(14213,0,0,0,0,'The brazier silently awaits an offering.',32144),
(14215,0,0,0,0,'You shudder, the memories of another life threatening to overpower you...',32305),
(14218,0,0,0,0,'We must take out as many of them as we can, $n.',0),
(14219,0,0,0,0,'The statue stands expectantly.',32144),
(14222,0,0,0,0,'We can do this, $n.',0),
(14223,0,0,0,0,'So, is it done, $c?',32144),
(14226,0,0,0,0,'Demons demons, always more demons. Like rabbits! But less cuddly... not so good for pulling out of hats either.',32305),
(14236,0,5,0,0,'There are still too many for us to get through.$B$BHave faith in yourself, $n. Let your true warrior heart shine through.',30706),
(14238,0,6,0,0,'You got them all?',30706),
(14242,0,6,0,0,'Perhaps you can help me to get out of this arcane cage?',30706),
(14246,0,0,0,0,'Have you found homes for the swoop eggs, $c?',32185),
(14256,0,0,0,0,'Now you see, $r. This is not a matter to be taken lightly.',32144),
(14261,0,6,0,60,'I wonder if there\'s any market for frozen, shattered drake parts. Maybe with a bit of marketing, I could pitch it as a new delicacy?',32305),
(14262,0,0,0,0,'I trust you left a trail of destruction in your wake?',32305),
(14264,0,0,0,0,'Tell me, minnow. Have you done as I asked?',32144),
(14284,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to assist the water revenant?',32144),
(14295,0,0,0,0,'Is the job finished?',32305),
(14296,0,274,0,0,'No no no, you\'ve got it all wrong. You were supposed to gather Energy from the Conduits before you came up here, remember?$B$BOne more time, with style!',32305),
(14297,0,1,0,0,'There\'s no way I\'m paying them for time in captivity. Greedy little punks.',32305),
(14300,0,274,0,0,'Um, no. You\'re not done. Get back in there and get toasty!',32305),
(14306,0,0,0,0,'Have you helped to deal with the lasher problem, $c?',32185),
(14307,0,0,0,0,'How goes our plight to the west?',32185),
(14309,0,0,0,0,'Well, did it work?',32185),
(14311,0,0,0,0,'Have you planted the Cenarion Seeds, $c?',32185),
(14314,0,0,0,0,'Have my people been freed, $r?',32185),
(14322,0,0,0,0,'Are they dead? Is it safe to go outside again?',32305),
(14329,0,0,0,0,'Have you discovered my daughter\'s whereabouts, $r?',32185),
(14334,0,0,0,0,'You get \'im, mon?',32185),
(14335,0,0,0,0,'Has our lobstrok problem been dealt with, $c?',32185),
(14340,0,0,0,0,'Hello.',32305),
(14342,0,0,0,0,'How are things at Mannoroc Coven, $r?',32185),
(14346,0,0,0,0,'Have you dealt with the naga in our crevasse, $n?',32185),
(14377,0,0,0,0,'What did you discover? You look pale, $c!',32305),
(14383,0,1,0,0,'I trust you\'ve dug a significant number of tiny graves along the coast, yes?',32305),
(14388,0,0,0,0,'Hey $n, you look shaken up. Did you scare the giant into going to the bathroom? Or yourself?',32305),
(14422,0,0,0,0,'My beautiful children may attempt to bite you upon release, but at their stage of physical development, it is unlikely that their attacks will be fatal.',32305),
(14471,0,0,0,0,'KABOOM!',32305),
(14472,0,1,0,0,'Sweet little piece of goblin technology, that thing is.',32305),
(14473,0,6,0,0,'What are you gonna do when Maxx Avalanche comes down on you, $n?! How\'s the hatchling hunting coming?',30706),
(14474,0,5,0,0,'I still see some out there! Please, $n, go get them before they drown!',30706),
(14476,0,0,0,0,'Did you get \'em? Did you get all three?',32305),
(14480,0,1,0,0,'The Gob Squad is famous - nastiest fighters out of all the Wrenchmen. Somehow they manage not to blow themselves up much either, which increases life expectancy a bit.',32305),
(14484,0,0,0,0,'You look to still be in one piece.',32305),
(14485,0,0,0,0,'Ticker\'s a man after my own heart. Couldn\'t be prouder.',32305),
(14488,1,0,0,0,'I don\'t remember ordering a cleaning service... why yes, I am Apothecary Hummel.$B$B...wait, what is the meaning of this? You think these meaningless papers can stop me? Hah!',12340),
(24433,0,0,0,0,'I trust you\'ve left our foes in complete disarray?',32305),
(24435,0,1,0,0,'After this, I think I may need to move away from the ocean. The smell of fish is almost too much to stand.',32305),
(24436,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a solid business model - Bedlam thought this one out pretty well.  We hire 3 times as many people as we intend to pay, and depend on the rest to lose their money to resurrection fees.$B$BSome of them even come back owing US money. Hah!',32305),
(24437,0,0,0,0,'I should probably grab up some of that land along the cliff too.  Hmm...',32305),
(24452,0,6,0,20,'Our stealth field generator has the same acronym as our rocket launcher. Probably poor planning on our part.',32305),
(24467,0,1,0,0,'I will be glad to be done with these wretches.',32305),
(24478,0,274,0,0,'No. Just no. Do it right this time.',32305),
(24479,0,274,0,0,'You\'re not very good at this. You\'re supposed to complete the trial BEFORE you come talk to me again. Make sense?',32305),
(24512,0,1,0,0,'It is a dangerous climb up and down the cliffs, but our ability to appear and disappear without warning is what will drive terror into the hearts of our foes.',32185),
(24517,0,1,0,0,'I take great pleasure in striking the Alliance and disappearing into these hills. They must think they are facing far greater numbers.',32185),
(24519,0,6,0,0,'Have you taken care of things?',32185),
(24525,0,1,0,0,'Thank you for helping me with this grim business, $n.',32185),
(24529,0,0,0,0,'How do things look in the quilboar camps, $c?',32185),
(24535,0,0,0,0,'Did you visit the ground where Thalorien fell defending the Sunwell?',12340),
(24539,0,1,0,0,'Be careful out there. The plants and animals of this jungle are outside of the natural order.',32185),
(24546,0,6,0,0,'Is the Alliance putting up a fight? How goes the battle for the Barrens?',32305),
(24552,0,1,0,0,'The Barrens is a harsh land, but I have come to love it. How are you faring?',32305),
(24563,0,0,0,0,'Did you visit the ground where Thalorien fell defending the Sunwell?',12340),
(24565,0,0,0,0,'This is a necessary task, $n, and I ask that you ensure enough are slain to prevent their spread.',32305),
(24566,0,0,0,0,'Did it work?',32305),
(24572,0,6,0,0,'Have you cleared out Taurajo?$B$BKilling those vultures is but a taste of the vengeance I plan to reap on these Theramore scum.',32305),
(24577,0,6,0,0,'What is this about? Why are you creating such a commotion in my camp?',32305),
(24587,0,1,0,0,'Ignis is not yet dead. The fire giant must fall!',26822),
(24601,0,0,0,0,'We must not allow the nightmare to spread further into our world!',32305),
(24603,0,0,0,0,'More!  Kill more of them!  MORE!',32305),
(24608,0,0,0,0,'Is he dead?',32305),
(24618,0,0,0,0,'Have you pushed them all the way back to their gates?',32305),
(24623,0,1,0,0,'Poor little tings.',0),
(24633,0,0,0,0,'I am sorry to ask this of you, but I want him to come here. He needs to leave that place of death...',32305),
(24637,0,5,0,0,'<Bloodhilt roars impatiently.>$B$BIs the deed done? Tell me! What news?',32305),
(24639,0,1,0,0,'Strength isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. Everytin has its time and place.',0),
(24642,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(24671,0,274,0,0,'Not enough cluckers, $n. We\'ll all starve.',30706),
(24687,0,0,0,0,'Remember the tale of Archimonde, $c.  The young lashers are much weaker than you, but they can still overrun you with their numbers.',32305),
(24690,0,0,0,0,'Please, $n.  Head up to the top of Fire Plume Ridge and show Blazerunner an early retirement.',32305),
(24692,0,0,0,0,'The colossus is a fearsome beast, $n.  By all means, if it starts to do anything suspicious, get out of its way!',32305),
(24695,0,0,0,0,'You have not yet completed my gauntlet, $n.',32305),
(24697,0,0,0,0,'Throw the meat, then let the dinosaurs chase you into the pit.  Easy as that!',32305),
(24703,0,0,0,0,'Your first quest is a simple one, yet it somehow remains unfinished.  Endure my words and become my squire.',32305),
(24704,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve not yet meted enough justice, squire.  You may complain to me only when 15 of the beasts are slayed.',32305),
(24706,0,0,0,0,'We have not completed our prayers.  Shall I join you?',32305),
(24759,0,1,0,0,'Power isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. Everytin has its time and place.',0),
(24762,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(24765,0,1,0,0,'Strength isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. This\'ll become more apparent as ya learn animal forms, but it holds true even now. Everytin\' has its time and place.',0),
(24768,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(24771,0,1,0,0,'Strength isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. Everytin has its time and place.',0),
(24774,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(24777,0,1,0,0,'Aim isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. Everytin has its time and place.',0),
(24780,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(24783,0,1,0,0,'Power isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. Everytin has its time and place.',0),
(24786,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(24817,0,5,0,0,'That monstrously humongous shark is not dead yet! Do I have to do everything myself?',30706),
(24855,0,0,0,0,'We cannot move forward until you have put an end to the bloodpetals, $c.',32305),
(24858,0,5,0,0,'There are still some naga banners down there that need to be \'sploded and replaced!',30706),
(24864,0,1,0,0,'That\'s not enough hatchlings.',30706),
(24868,0,6,0,0,'What\'s wrong?',30706),
(24901,0,6,0,0,'That\'s not enough, hon. Can you take care of more of them?',30706),
(24907,0,1,0,0,'You\'re under quota. Clear out more of the sea giants.',32305),
(24910,0,0,0,0,'What\'s with the premature bail-out? We gotta get back out there.',32305),
(24915,0,0,0,0,'What is that you hold, $c?$B$BIt calls out to me, stirring feelings I thought to be long dead.',0),
(24916,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $c? How can I assist you?',0),
(24917,0,0,0,0,'Whatdya got there, $r?',0),
(24918,0,0,0,0,'What is it, $r?',0),
(24919,0,0,0,0,'How may I be of service, $r?',0),
(24925,0,6,0,0,'Can you free a few more, please?',30706),
(24927,0,0,0,0,'Look, if you think the bare minimum is enough, then ok. But some people choose to kill more pirates and I encourage that, ok?$B$BAnd by \"ok\", I mean \"go kill more and stop wasting my time\".',32305),
(24928,0,0,0,0,'What part of \"to the ground\" don\'t you understand, $c?',32305),
(24929,0,5,0,0,'$n, I still hear Yngwie yelling!',30706),
(24932,0,0,0,0,'There\'s still plenty of those things out there, pal. Keep at it!',32305),
(24942,0,0,0,0,'You still have a few goblin zombies to deal with, $n. Look sharp, superstar!',30706),
(24945,0,6,0,0,'Um, boss, look, I don\'t know how to say this, but you might have missed one or two of those pygmy witch doctors.$B$BI\'m just saying.',30706),
(24950,0,0,0,0,'I\'m flattered that you\'d rather stay here and flirt with me than go kill that pirate captain. So flattered that I might not fire you if you get going right now and do it already.',32305),
(24951,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t see any bug with you, pal.',32305),
(24955,0,0,0,0,'Babe, there\'s still blank spots on this sheet. Being near ogres isn\'t rubbing off on your intelligence, I hope.',32305),
