(26091,0,0,0,0,'Save my wolf, $n.',0),
(26094,0,1,0,0,'At last, we finally have a chance to hurt the Dark Iron attackers.',0),
(26099,0,1,0,0,'This is justice.',32144),
(26102,0,6,0,0,'If we can defeat General Grimaxe, the Dark Iron forces won\'t be able to regroup.',0),
(26106,0,0,0,0,'We haven\'t found the right combination yet, $n.  Keep at it!  I\'m sure you can figure it out!',27219),
(26115,0,6,0,0,'Now do you understand?',32144),
(26118,0,1,0,0,'We must stop the ambassador before he causes more harm.',0),
(26126,0,0,0,0,'We haven\'t found the right combination yet, $n.  Keep at it!  I\'m sure you can figure it out!',0),
(26130,0,25,0,0,'You must slay each of those ogre magi to stop their rituals and disconnect L\'ghorek from the one below.',0),
(26132,0,1,0,0,'There are still more fiends to be destroyed.',27219),
(26133,0,1,0,0,'Not all of the fiends have been destroyed.',0),
(26135,0,1,0,0,'The ruins are surely still swarming with naga. Pay close attention to their patrols and I\'m sure you\'ll be able to slip through.',0),
(26142,0,0,0,0,'I GROW WEAKER. YOU MUST DESTROY... MORE CONDUITS BEFORE... I DIE.',0),
(26146,0,6,0,0,'Loch Modan is under siege, $n!  We need every able-bodied member of the Alliance to aid our cause.  Have you killed those troggs yet?',0),
(26170,0,0,0,0,'Quickly, friend.  This is but the calm before the storm.',25961),
