(26223,0,5,0,0,'Show them the might of Revantusk!',32638),
(26224,0,5,0,0,'Clear your head of impure thoughts, $r. Become one with the wilds!',32638),
(26228,0,0,0,0,'Be careful with my old house. I plan to hand that off to my kids when they move out.',0),
(26229,0,5,0,0,'I just want those kobolds dead. Dead!',0),
(26237,0,0,0,0,'Did you destroy the harvest watchers?',0),
(26238,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t be loitering\' around the village all day now. If you\'re staying with us, I expect you to fight for us.',32638),
(26240,0,0,0,0,'Back so soon? Don\'t be shy, now.',32638),
(26245,0,0,0,0,'Did you find out what happened to the Storm\'s Fury?',0),
(26248,0,0,0,0,'The spirits always have something to say to those who will listen.',0),
(26250,0,0,0,0,'Hail, $n.',0),
(26251,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?',0),
(26254,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $n?',0),
(26257,0,6,0,0,'Did you find the golems?',0),
(26258,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $n?',0),
(26261,0,0,0,0,'What have we discovered?',0),
(26263,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not as old as I look, $r... I can still hear that dwarf from here.',32638),
(26267,0,1,0,0,'Don\'t get caught offguard. Even if one slime doesn\'t seem like much, once one gets you pinned down... the others won\'t be far behind.',32638),
(26273,0,1,0,0,'Power stems from dis world and worlds you\'ve not yet seen. Masterin\' da power of one ain\'t gonna be enough ta make it outside of dese trainin\' grounds - you gonna need to be pullin ya power from all of dem.',0),
(26276,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(26278,0,0,0,0,'I start you out with the simplest task for a reason, $n.  Do not fail me.',32305);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `EmoteOnCompleteDelay`, `EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(26279,0,0,0,0,'I need Mizjah to be cleaned of ogres, $n.  Now get to it!',32305),
(26280,0,0,0,0,'Beware the murloc fighter, $n.  In my experience his size usually belies his strength.',32305),
(26288,0,6,0,0,NULL,0),
(26304,0,0,0,0,'Please, $n... put out the awful fires.',32305),
(26306,0,0,0,0,'You\'d better not get cold feet on me.',32638),
(26307,0,0,0,0,'What are you waiting for?',32638),
(26308,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll be quite busy if you want to spill as much blood as they have.',32638),
(26312,0,1,0,0,'Perhaps it was foolish of me to let dem be pressin\' out so far. Everythin\' I know of da earth elementals told me an attack like dis couldn\'t be lastin\'... dat dey were just lashin\' out in dere rage, and would be leavin\' just as quickly.$B$BIt be very clear now dat I was wrong.',0),
(26314,0,0,0,0,'Did it work, mon?',0),
(26315,0,6,0,0,'Did ya confront Boden yet?',0),
(26321,0,0,0,0,'She\'s still looking a little scrawny, $n.  Maybe some more murloc meat is in order.',32305),
(26338,0,0,0,0,'We appreciate what you\'re doing for us here in Grom\'gol, $n.',32305),
(26357,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t see enough lights burnin\', $c. Better get goin\'.',32638),
(26359,0,0,0,0,'Your vision not Ohgan\'aka\'s, no.$b$bYou are not ready.',32305),
(26360,0,0,0,0,'Extra-big spells need extra-big brains, yes.',32305),
(26362,0,0,0,0,'Where is $n\'aka?',32305),
(26367,0,0,0,0,'Ongo\'longo still lies in chains.',32638),
(26374,0,6,0,0,'Have you found my missing troops?$B$BBe sure to search every filthy back-alley. If there\'s trouble, they\'ll find it.',0),
(26375,0,0,0,0,'It is unbearable to watch. They know no mercy. They should be offered none.',0),
(26376,0,1,0,0,'Take your time, fleshling.$B$BI am in no hurry.',0),
(26377,0,0,0,0,'BThey will learn respect for the earth...$B$BPiece by piece...$B$BRock by rock...$B$B...with time.',0),
(26387,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t get squeamish on me. I\'d be over there ripping open cocoons myself if I didn\'t have to keep all this equipment running.',32638),
(26390,0,6,0,0,'Have you found Kurtok?',0),
(26405,0,0,0,0,'Zul\'Mamwe, though ruined, is still a defensible stronghold.  Take heed, $r.',32305),
(26429,0,1,0,0,'Haven\'t completed my task yet? Are you scared, coward?',32638),
(26438,0,0,0,0,'I do not know why the flayers hunger so. Many things have changed since the rift opened between our worlds.',0),
(26439,0,0,0,0,'<Berracite grumbles, and you feel the reverberations gradually roll by under your feet.>',0),
(26448,0,5,0,0,'Are there not demons yet standing?  You call yourself a $r?  This is no time to be taking a break from the fighting!',30920),
(26499,0,1,0,0,'Rally more of our troops, $n.',0),
(26500,0,25,0,0,'Are you going to pull your fleshy weight, $r?',0),
(26512,0,6,0,0,'What are you waiting around here for?',0),
(26519,0,0,0,0,'<The orb emanates powerful magic.>',0),
(26534,0,0,0,0,'Come back when that pitcher\'s empty, $n.',32305),
(26537,0,25,0,0,'I need you to shatter a few more, $n.',0),
(26538,0,274,0,0,'Speak quickly! What do you want?$B$BDon\'t let the Warchief see us talking...',0),
(26550,0,0,0,0,'You have not done as I asked, $r.  Perhaps I was wrong to have selected you for this task...',32305),
(26575,0,0,0,0,'Rough times, these...',0),
(26578,0,0,0,0,'I am not yet convinced that you have more value than the filth I have sent you to cleanse.',0),
(26579,0,1,0,0,'We have escaped the curse of flesh for this long; I will not see my brothers fall to such weaknesses now.',0),
(26581,0,1,0,0,'The fighting at the temple has quieted since you left. Whatever impression you\'re making, it seems to have helped at least that much.',0),
(26583,0,1,0,0,'I cannot fit inside. Our elementals are not up to the task.$B$BYou must see this done.',0),
(26584,0,1,0,0,'Strangely, your size and resourcefulness are starting to prove quite useful.',0),
(26591,0,1,0,0,'There are more injured Earthen on the front.',0),
(26601,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been waiting for this moment, $n.',32305),
(26602,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $r?',32305),
(26604,0,6,0,0,'Please, $g my hero: sister;, dispose of the stalking panthers!',32305),
