(26989,0,6,0,0,'What have you to report, $nnub?',0),
(27000,0,1,0,0,'The spiders tend to be a little skittish.  One of the mustangs should be enough to scare them away.',32638),
(27001,0,1,0,0,'I don\'t need you to kill the spiders... that\'s what these soldiers are for.  Think of it as killing two birds with one stone: we\'re getting rid of the spiders, and the recruits are getting valuable combat experience.',32638),
(27006,0,6,0,0,'What\'d ya see? What are those cheese lovers up ta?',27291),
(27008,0,6,0,0,'What did you see? What are the Twilight\'s Hammer doing at the Masters\' Gate?',0),
(27013,0,0,0,0,'I have a family to raise, and I need to do whatever I can to protect them.',32638),
(27016,0,1,0,0,'It\'s okay, $n. It happens to a lot of $cs. Being unable to live up to my greatness is nothing to be ashamed of.',25961),
(27042,0,5,0,0,'Yer gonna have ta do better than that, $g laddie : missy;!$B$BNow get back up there an\' finish the job or do I have ta go an\' do it myself?',27291),
(27043,0,6,0,0,'Have you not managed to gain the elemental wards and defeat Haethen Kaul yet?',0),
(27045,0,6,0,0,'News from Yorick?',0),
(27055,0,0,0,0,'How is your investigation proceeding, $n?',32638),
