(27381,0,0,0,0,'Any luck?',32638),
(27382,0,0,0,0,'The road I walk is lonely, but I do so for duty.',32638),
(27406,0,5,0,0,'Lord Vincent Godfrey. The name itself evokes feelings of dread in the hearts of worgen.',32305),
(27412,0,1,0,0,'You look pretty satisfied with yourself. Come to claim the bounty on that monstrous raptor?',32305),
(27415,0,0,0,0,'You must hurry to the Dragonmurk, $n. With Onyxia\'s eggs riddled around the Wyrmbog, we face overwhelming numbers unless something is done quickly.$b$bDestroy her eggs! Don\'t let the black dragon plague spread across our homeland!',32305),
(27420,0,0,0,0,'If the Cenarion Circle is ever going to return the Fungal Vale to its original, healthy state, those plague disseminators must be the first things to go.',32638),
(27421,0,0,0,0,'I am confident that nature will find a foothold within those ziggurats.',32638),
(27431,0,0,0,0,'What have you found, $n?',0),
(27448,0,0,0,0,'Once we get to Light\'s Shield Tower, the boys can head over to Light\'s Hope Chapel.  It\'s close enough that they can walk.',32638),
(27464,0,0,0,0,'Your test is not yet complete.',32722),
(27465,0,0,0,0,'The three of you still have a job to do.',32722),
(27467,0,0,0,0,'Are you still here?',32722),
(27472,5,0,0,0,'Today marks a new beginning for the Forsaken and the end of the Alliance in Lordaeron!',15595),
(27477,0,6,0,0,'Have I told you lately that I hate you?',32722),
(27483,0,5,0,0,'The people of Dalaran must suffer for what they did to me!',32305),
(27490,0,25,0,0,'I need you to escort those SI:7 agents safely to their destination, $n.',27326),
(27491,0,25,0,0,'I need you to get those Kor\'kon assassins safely to their destination, $n.',0),
(27492,0,6,0,0,'What\'s the matter? You Alliance $g boys : girls; don\'t have the stomach to get the job done?$B$B<Kurdran gives you a wink.>$B$BNeed me to fly over there and kill them for you?',27326),
(27493,0,6,0,0,'There are more to be killed, $r. You do have the stomach for that, yes?',0),
(27496,0,25,0,0,'I need you to go back to the Twilight Gate and mark those buildings for bombardment.',27326),
(27497,0,1,0,0,'We need those buildings to be marked if our bombardment is to be effective.',0),
(27505,0,25,0,0,'Keep the menders safe as they heal our wounded dragons!',0),
(27506,0,6,0,0,'Have you done as I asked?',0),
(27507,0,1,0,0,'It was inevitable I suppose. We\'ve kept them out for far longer than I thought we could. They were sure to find a way eventually.',0),
(27509,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the breach?',0),
(27510,0,6,0,0,'Have you killed the \"bears?\"',32305),
