(29780,1,0,0,0,'Following the Huojin discipline often means making the hard decisions. This is one of those moments.',20253),
(29799,1,0,0,0,'We need to get the healers to the wound and keep them safe!',20253),
(29865,0,0,0,0,'The silkwood stalkers are not in balance with nature. Predators are one thing but these creatures kill for pleasure. Harmony must be restored.',27326),
(29877,0,0,0,0,'Man, those virmen is dumb.',27356),
(29883,0,0,0,0,'If we can win over the jinyu, they may allow us to stay.',27326),
(29898,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps I could bring some of these healing waters back to Stormwind with me.',27326),
(29899,0,0,0,0,'The howls are lessening... already.',27326),
(29903,0,0,0,0,'The jinyu are skilled in different ways. It is up to us to find their strengths.',27326),
(29904,0,0,0,0,'How are those trainees looking?',27326),
(29910,0,0,0,0,'The marmots won\'t be happy when you try to fill in their holes.',27356),
(29916,0,18,0,0,'I wish I were brave enough to fight them, but...',27356),
(29917,0,0,0,0,'What will Master Shang say when he finds out?',27356),
(29920,0,0,0,0,'Each of the pandriarchs earned their reputation in life and retained them afterward.  I can\'t even imagine how you will defeat them.',27326),
(29926,0,0,0,0,'Never thought nibblers would be a big enough threat to choke up the whole mine.',27326),
(29944,0,0,0,0,'The virmen here have strange habits. Stranger names.',27356),
(29946,0,0,0,0,'Ready when you are, $n.$b$bYou go ahead. I\'ll meet you down there.',27356),
(29947,0,0,0,0,'Go, torment those virmen, $n!',27356),
(29952,0,0,0,0,'...',27356),
(29981,0,0,0,0,'If the flying mantid troops have always been able to fly over, why haven\'t they before now?',27366),
(29982,0,0,0,0,'Once these mantid are slain, we can get to work repairing the wall and restoring the town to its normal state.',27366),
(29984,0,0,0,0,'If you cannot pass this test, then there is probably no reason to continue our training.',27366),
(29985,0,0,0,0,'Living outside of society has its advantages. I can focus all my energies on training, without being shackled to the societal conventions of modesty, politics, and basic personal hygiene. Here in the woods, I am free to be myself.',27366),
(29986,0,0,0,0,'See if you can light one of the wards while one of the mist incarnations is nearby.',27366),
(29987,0,0,0,0,'I\'m prepared, $n. Are you?',27366),
(29989,0,0,0,0,'This test will be trying. You will test the strength of your fists against the strength of stone. Steel yourself, $n.$b$bNot literally, of course.$b$bUnless you normally wear steel gloves... in which case, you may literally steel yourself.',27366),
(29999,0,0,0,0,'I hope they didn\'t give you too much trouble.',27326),
(30001,0,0,0,0,'I can see the moths eating the pages from here!',27326),
(30002,0,0,0,0,'My stomach is too fragile to handle the squashing of bugs. Is it done?',27326),
(30005,0,0,0,0,'I love to see fireworks lighting up the sky!',27326),
(30027,0,1,0,0,'Picking up your first weapon is also a symbolic gesture. Every $c that leaves these training grounds must be ready to take up arms in defense of their fellow pandaren.',0),
(30029,0,0,0,0,'Oh good, they didn\'t turn you into a frog yet. I saw them do that once you know.',27356),
(30030,0,0,0,0,'Oh why? Why did I have to tamper with the natural order of things? All I wanted was to make these grains grow faster and more numerous.',27356),
(30031,0,0,0,0,'None of this seems to taste sweet enough! What\'s the deal?',27356),
(30033,0,1,0,0,'Picking up your first weapon is also a symbolic gesture. Every $c that leaves these training grounds must be ready to take up arms in defense of their fellow pandaren.',20886),
(30050,0,0,0,0,'Water my plants you lazy $c!',27356),
(30051,0,0,0,0,'That Stormstout feller says that he\'s the best brewer that ever was. Might be true, couldn\'t tell ya one way or the \'nother as of yet.',27356),
(30058,0,0,0,0,'Have you vanquished the beast?',27356),
(30073,0,0,0,0,'It takes more than three seconds to make beer, $n. Even when your name is Chen Stormstout.',27366),
(30075,0,0,0,0,'This brewery - it\'s a disgrace to the Stormstout name! Something needs to be done!',27366),
(30077,0,0,0,0,'Barrels.',27366),
(30078,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s do this.',27366),
(30079,0,0,0,0,'Something definitely not right! Pandaren supposed to be HAPPY!',27366),
(30083,0,0,0,0,'We cannot let the saurok walk all over us anymore.',27366),
(30089,0,0,0,0,'This must be the emperor\'s sad coming back! That is some oooold sad.$B$BKen-Ken bet pandaren sad get stronger with age, too, like pandaren booze.',27366),
(30091,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know why this is happening, but I can say for certain that those elementals were the start of it all.',27366),
(30135,0,0,0,0,'The Order rarely meddles with the natural balance on this island, but it is too important to save the serpents.',27326),
(30136,0,0,0,0,'Did you return the hatchlings to their nests?',27326),
(30169,0,0,0,0,'Slovan has always been a nuisance, but with the Crane Temple\'s defenses down he has become a true threat.',27366),
(30181,0,0,0,0,'They didn\'t send ya\' runin\' did they?',27366),
(30182,0,0,0,0,'I used to go on fox hunts with my father. If he could see me now! Hunting in Pandaria!',27366),
(30183,0,0,0,0,'What\'s your count up to?',27366),
(30252,0,0,0,0,'I really wasn\'t cut out for this type of work. I didn\'t exactly grow up in the country.',27356),
(30254,0,0,0,0,'Well, go ahead - bust that soil up and plant the seeds!$B$BYou aren\'t giving up already are you? I need your help!',27356),
(30270,0,0,0,0,'We cannot risk any more saurok ambushes, but we\'re in no position to take them on in force. Fortunately, with you here, we shouldn\'t need to.',27366),
(30271,0,0,0,0,'Look for Crane Wing pandaren who are falling to despair and slay sha near them while I support you!',27366),
(30272,0,0,0,0,'We shouldn\'t press further into the temple before clearing out some of the sha presence outside.',27366),
(30349,0,0,0,0,'Kang has been sharing stories with me about these mogu.$b$bApparently ages ago they ruled as emperors subjugating all free races of Pandaria and the surrounding regions. Now they are little more than hoodlums.$b$bTo see these mogu fight though, I suspect they are trying to rekindle some of their older ideals and ambitions.',27366),
(30352,0,0,0,0,'As far as I\'m concerned, paying you to kill these birds is the same as me shooting them myself. You just get to be my gun as it were.',27366),
(30354,0,0,0,0,'I will not have my people condemned to slavery and torture at hands of the mogu.',27366),
(30356,0,0,0,0,'We cannot hope to beat these mogu if their numbers keep growing.',27366);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `EmoteOnCompleteDelay`, `EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(30357,0,0,0,0,'These mantid are a much bigger threat than I think even the pandaren give them credit for.',27366),
(30359,0,0,0,0,'Lyalia is the only family I have left. I had to bury her mother during the war of Ahn\'Qiraj.',27366),
(30361,0,0,0,0,'It has been many thousands of years since mantid were seen on this side of the Great Wall.',27366),
(30384,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the tauren scout? Our presence must be kept a secret. The horde can NOT know we are here.',27366),
(30457,0,1,0,0,'If the war leader of the yaungol is slain, surely our village will be saved and the refugees will be able to return to their farms.',27377),
(30460,0,1,0,0,'There are yet more injured warriors in need of aid, $c.',27377),
(30468,0,396,0,0,'Are they dead?',27377),
(30480,0,6,0,0,'That... was not what I expected.',27377),
(30491,0,0,0,0,'The grummles always insist they have better luck with cleaned yaks.$b$bAs long as they pay more I\'m not going to argue. We need the gold. Now more than ever.',27377),
(30495,0,0,0,0,'Did you deliver the jade in time?',27326),
(30500,0,0,0,0,'This, it seems, is only the tip of the iceberg, $n.',27326),
(30502,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the jade, $n?',27326),
(30512,0,0,0,0,'I will not rest until our people are returned and this village rebuilt.',27377),
(30514,0,0,0,0,'As long as Ur-Bataar lives, we cannot have peace.',27377),
(30568,0,0,0,0,'Is everyone in order and ready to move?',27326),
(30571,0,6,0,0,'Look, $g mister : lady;, I don\'t mean to be telling you your business, but I can still see a lot of my farmhands still out there.',27377),
(30575,0,274,0,0,'It\'s going to take more yaks than that to get this place back into fightin\' condition, $n, yes it is.',27377),
(30593,0,6,0,0,'Please tell me that you have the Mogujia situation under control. Please?',27377),
(30599,0,0,0,0,'Hozen are learning that it is most bad fortune to get sacrificed on one\'s own altar.',27377),
(30601,0,1,0,0,'Did you find the hiding guides?',27377),
(30604,0,0,0,0,'This is not vengeance or fortune, it is survival.',27377),
(30608,0,0,0,0,'Other grummles say I not have good luck. The call me \"Luckydon\'t\".$b$bBut now I have friend $r who is a big luckydo! We\'ll show them.',27377),
(30610,0,0,0,0,'Grummles are good at carrying things.',27377),
(30611,0,0,0,0,'We found a yak. Did you take out some hozen?',27377),
(30616,0,0,0,0,'A luckydon\'t travels a trail during a yaungol raid. A luckydo hires a big fighter type to help.',27377),
(30619,0,6,0,0,'Did you find him? Is he dead? No? Oh, man. Don\'t make me worried!',27377),
(30622,0,0,0,0,'Look at the SIZE of that thing...',27366),
(30651,0,6,0,0,'I\'m a wee bit surprised by the lack o\' explosions I\'ve seen so far.$B$BAre you well?',27377),
(30665,0,0,0,0,'Have you dealt with the yaungol yet?',27377),
(30666,0,0,0,0,'What would make the crocs attack like this?',27366),
(30675,0,0,0,0,'This must be it!',0),
(30683,0,396,0,0,'Nephew Bentnail has already eaten two days worth of food. I hope you found us more!',27377),
(30690,0,396,0,0,'Is Malevolent Fury gone?',27377),
(30691,0,0,0,0,'Please, $n. Even the great beasts of this world have a right to die in dignity.',27366),
(30694,0,0,0,0,'Well, I don\'t see any spikes in your face. That\'s a good sign.',27366),
(30695,0,0,0,0,'Koro said there\'s a pagoda on either side of the temple. Let\'s find them and wipe out the sha presence in both.',27366),
(30715,0,0,0,0,'Our comrades, are they at rest?',27377),
(30723,0,5,0,0,'Killing those birds may not soothe my anger, but at least it proves that we are better than our enemies. They would not do such a thing.',27377),
(30742,0,0,0,0,'I shoulda never fed them goots.',27377),
(30743,0,0,0,0,'On the bright side, Uncle Keenbean can label the last batch of Kafa\'goot as \"Limited Release\" and sell it for even more!',27377),
(30744,0,0,0,0,'<This should be more than enough berries to satisfy Uncle Keenbean.>',0),
(30745,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t wanna fight yetis? Can\'t say I blame you.',27377),
(30747,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t push our luck... we promised her hozens-smashies.',27377),
(30750,0,0,0,0,'Come on, come on.',27377),
(30772,0,0,0,0,'I like to attack problems head on.',27377),
(30773,0,0,0,0,'Fire is a cruel weapon. Luckily, we are only using it to destroy weapons of war.',27377),
(30774,0,0,0,0,'How did it go?',27377),
(30775,0,0,0,0,'How could they have betrayed me? They were once my brothers!$B$BWhy did they turn on me? WHY?$B$BI hate them! I will slaughter them all!',27377),
(30776,0,0,0,0,'Jung Duk\'s legacy is written in the blood of innocents.',27377),
(30778,0,0,0,0,'The stench of death is overpowering.',27377),
(30779,0,0,0,0,'It is better to be safe than sorry.',27377),
(30783,0,0,0,0,'Our people are possessed by hatred. We must help them come to their senses!',27377),
(30784,0,0,0,0,'If I could change the past, I would. If I could take Lin\'s place, I would.$B$BIn a thousand lifetimes, I will never be able to repay Suna\'s loss, or share even a measure of her grief.',27377),
(30786,0,0,0,0,'I will not die before having my revenge.',27377),
(30788,0,0,0,0,'Golgoss is no coward. He will relish the opportunity for revenge.',27377),
(30789,0,0,0,0,'Arconiss\' size belies his prowess in battle. He will be an asset.',27377),
(30792,0,0,0,0,'I require more mist. I am fading...',27377),
(30796,0,0,0,0,'Have you disposed of the spirits yet?',27377),
(30798,0,0,0,0,'Have you gone to the Tomb of Secrets yet?',27377),
(30801,0,0,0,0,'Have you read the tablet?',27377),
(30804,0,0,0,0,'So many strangers in these lands these days. Luckily you $c seem to be all right.',27377),
(30805,0,0,0,0,'Are they dead? Have you dealt with them?',27377),
(30814,0,0,0,0,'We are slowly gaining ground.',27377),
(30820,0,0,0,0,'You must light the incense to honor the dead.',27377),
(30829,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll need to bind my essence to the Tongue, then you can use it to speak with me from anywhere.',27377),
(30888,0,1,0,0,'The defenders on the wall are stretched thin. The Yaungol are pushing through the gates to Kun-Lai in the north. The mantid are pouring against the gates to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. I hear that there\'s been a breach into the Valley of Four Winds in the south too.$B$BWe do not have the men to combat all of these threats.',27377),
(30889,0,1,0,0,'These traps have been very effective, the mantid numbers are just getting out of hand in these past weeks.',27377),
(30890,0,1,0,0,'This whole battlefront is being worked to the bone. We need more men out here.',27377),
(30892,0,1,0,0,'With the constant mantid attacks, the men are being worked to the bone. We are undermanned on all fronts.$B$BYour help means a lot to us, $n.',27377),
(30893,0,1,0,0,'Our vigil is never-ending.',27377),
(30896,0,1,0,0,'I haven\'t hated plants so much since my job back at Halfhill.',27377),
(30898,0,1,0,0,'I can\'t remember the last time they swarmed this thickly. They probably haven\'t within my lifetime.',27377),
(30925,0,0,0,0,'Niuzao does not move quickly, nor does he make rash decisions. Perform his task, and give him time to decide.',27377),
(30927,0,0,0,0,'I should have gone with them.',27377),
(30928,0,0,0,0,'Even among our own order, only a few chosen elders knew of our sacred duty to contain the Sha of Fear.$b$bWhy they chose to tell the yak-keeper, I may never know.',27377),
(30929,0,0,0,0,'This yak is not a good yak. Not at all.',27377),
(30930,0,0,0,0,'See? I told you! No good yaks.',27377),
(30932,0,0,0,0,'Any luck?',27377),
(30944,0,1,0,0,'Are the villagers recovering?',27377),
(30946,0,1,0,0,'What did the prisoner have to say?',27377),
(30967,0,0,0,0,'If we can rescue the dissenters, perhaps we can rebuild somewhere else...',27377),
(30970,0,1,0,0,'The Sha of Hatred\'s passing did this to them. I doubt this is the only thing that will have been affected by its passing.',27377),
(30973,0,1,0,0,'Creative solution.  Lao-Chin impresses.',27377),
(30977,0,1,0,0,'Our vigil continues...',27377),
(30983,0,0,0,0,NULL,0),
(30984,0,0,0,0,NULL,0),
(30991,0,0,0,0,'Wha? I was just thinking about my poor, poor beer...',27377),
(30993,0,0,0,0,'Here we are, then.',27377),
(30995,0,0,0,0,NULL,0),
(30996,0,0,0,0,NULL,0),
(31007,0,0,0,0,'They have forsaken our ways and they will pay dearly for it.',27377),
(31011,0,1,0,0,'The village must be saved!',27377),
(31020,0,0,0,0,'I have been sleeping for many thousands of years. I must regain my strength before rejoining the Council.',27377),
(31021,0,0,0,0,'Do you understand, Wakener? The amber gives life.',27377),
(31022,0,0,0,0,'What has happened to our home? Things feel amiss.',27377),
(31026,0,0,0,0,'The swarm knows not of their terrible folly! These precious trees must be protected at all costs!',27377),
(31032,0,1,0,0,'Some of them can make it through the smoke, but in small enough numbers that we can easily pick them off.',27377),
(31058,0,0,0,0,'These hozen pack some mean toys and some meaner brews.',27366),
(31065,0,1,0,0,'Go. Look.',27377),
(31066,0,0,0,0,'The order stands. Slay the fallen paragon.',27377),
(31067,0,6,0,0,'Azzix, his name was. I think. Azzix K\'tai.',27377),
(31069,0,0,0,0,'You needn\'t look far to find shade around here, friend.',27377),
(31074,0,0,0,0,'<Lya looks concerned.>',27377),
(31079,0,0,0,0,'We hate being eaten.',27377),
(31082,0,0,0,0,'The collection pit is down the hill, just to the west of here.',27377),
(31084,0,0,0,0,'...',27377),
(31085,0,0,0,0,'Make sure to bring that forked blade with you.',27377),
(31088,0,1,0,0,'Have the harvesters been punished?',27377),
(31129,0,0,0,0,'You are brave to have come across the wall, $r.',27377),
(31130,0,420,0,0,'There is nothing like a little manual labor to bring strangers together, don\'t you think?',27326),
(31133,0,0,0,0,'Can\'t stand those mantid.',27377),
(31139,6,0,0,0,'Have you beaten back the Blackrock worgs?',0),
(31140,5,0,0,0,'Kill the spies!',0),
(31144,0,0,0,0,'Kill the goblin assassins',0),
(31158,0,1,0,0,'Strength isn\'t da end all of defeating ya enemy, and it most certainly isn\'t tha end all of stayin\' alive. Fightin\' is about balance. Everytin has its time and place.',0),
(31161,0,1,0,0,'All trolls gotta prove demselves before we let them move past da training grounds.',0),
(31181,0,0,0,0,'What\'s wrong, green? You aren\'t afraid of the dark, icy sea are you?',27377),
(31182,0,0,0,0,'In the words of my old deck boss: \"Do what I say, \'cause I said it!\"',27377),
(31185,0,0,0,0,'Dog deserves all the freedom the sea has to offer him - I\'ve tried to set him free, but he won\'t go.$B$BBest we can do anymore is take him out for walks now and then.',27377),
(31187,0,0,0,0,'You smell that, green?$B$B<Arie takes a big, dramatic whiff of rank, fishy air.>$B$BSmells like money!',27377),
(31189,0,0,0,0,'Go give Ju Lien a hand, would ya?',27377),
(31228,0,0,0,0,'Is Khar\'zul dead?',27377),
(31230,0,0,0,0,'Any luck?',27326),
(31265,0,0,0,0,'No, I don\'t have a \"chaser!\" Just drink it!',27377),
(31285,0,0,0,0,'It is always good luck to have a grummle aboard when traveling through a saurok infested cave.',27356),
(31287,0,0,0,0,'It is unwise to challenge the domain of Madam Goya.',27356),
(31319,0,0,0,0,'My thoughts will be with your companions, $n.$b$bMay they be made whole again soon.',27326),
(31394,0,0,0,0,'Are you finished with the White Tiger\'s tasks?',27377),
(31440,0,15,0,0,'The four tomes contain secrets that have damned this place and all associated with it to an eternity of suffering.$B$BThey must be destroyed!',0),
(31490,0,1,0,0,'You know, I\'ve been killing the ones that you can\'t see behind closed doors.$B$BBut I need to maintain this disguise. So if you could just take care of all of the ones out there in the open, that\'d be great.',0),
(31495,0,1,0,0,'You know, I\'ve been killing the ones that you can\'t see behind closed doors.$B$BBut I need to maintain this disguise. So if you could just take care of all of the ones out there in the open, that\'d be great.',0),
(31514,0,0,0,0,'<The deed is not yet done. There can be no end to the Scarlet Crusade while Whitemane can come back from the dead.>',0),
(31516,0,0,0,0,'<The deed is not yet done. There can be no end to the Scarlet Crusade while Whitemane can come back from the dead.>',0),
(31606,0,0,0,0,'<cough cough>$B$BMy head...',27377),
(31611,0,0,0,0,'Ah, still alive I see...',27377),
(31613,0,0,0,0,'Sprites, jade destroyers, rocks that talk. This world is becoming a troublesome one.$b$bBut... nothing that can not be solved with a strong brew and winning smile.$b$bAnd a solid punch or two.',27326),
(31660,0,0,0,0,'Let me know if you want to be dropped into a sea of swarmborn. It would entertain me greatly.',27377),
(31676,0,0,0,0,'The mogu of Clan Gurthan are quilen lords. Do not wake their guardians.',27377),
(31687,0,6,0,0,'How did it go?',27377),
(31688,0,6,0,0,'Did you find him?',27377),
(31693,0,0,0,0,NULL,0),
(31732,0,5,0,0,'What are you waiting for?! Scorch the ground beneath them!',27326),
(31735,0,0,0,0,'We will complete our mission, but right now our priority is that warlock!',27326),
(31738,0,0,0,0,'It is easier to harbor hatred than to make peace.',27326),
(31741,0,0,0,0,'Gol\' dang, but there\'s a bunch of \'em down there...',27326),
(31742,0,0,0,0,'Pretty scary-lookin\' characters around here...',27326),
(31743,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that you\'ve got, $glad:lass;? Some kind o\' flare?$b$bShoot, I coulda put together a better flare\'n that in half a wink, if Rell had only asked.',27326),
(31744,0,0,0,0,'Those poor, wee little cubs. Go, help \'em out, $n. Do what\'s right.',27326),
(31765,0,5,0,0,'What are you waiting for?! Get on those guns!',0),
(31766,0,0,0,0,'What?',0),
(31780,0,0,0,0,NULL,0),
(31812,0,0,0,0,'Who be sendin\' you to face Zunta?',30706),
(31813,0,0,0,0,'I fear nothing. I will not be defeated!',30706),
(31814,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a curious sort.',32028),
(32038,0,0,0,0,'How goes the hunt?',27366),
(32175,0,0,0,0,'My, my. Well done!',0),
(32250,0,0,0,0,'Gorehowl thirsts for Alliance blood.',0),
(33059,0,0,0,0,'<The Prophet is deep in thought. He looks troubled.>',27547),
(33062,0,396,0,0,'We\'re going to capture the All-Seeing Eye and break its will.$B$BThis is the way that we\'ll be able to scry upon the Shadow Council at Gul\'var without them knowing it\'s us.',27547),
(33078,0,0,0,0,'What did you find?',27547),
(33082,0,0,0,0,'You must understand a man\'s life before taking it.',27547),
(33112,0,0,0,0,'The demon must be put to the test if we\'re to find out what\'s happening at Gul\'var.',27547),
(33115,0,5,0,0,'Once the shrouding stones are destroyed, we\'ll turn our attention to breaking this demon\'s will.',27547),
(33120,0,1,0,0,'I know it may seem harsh, and I\'ll understand if you decide not to do it.$B$BHowever, the sooner you kill those poor creatures, the sooner their suffering will come to an end.',27547),
